{"h":"<p>一个简单的工作流程，包括使用 Z 图像检查点生成图像，还包括 Controlnet。<br><br>** 如果<u>模型补丁加载器</u>发生节点错误，请尝试根据我在工作流程中提供的注释修复它。<br><br><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/8aba58be-d439-4743-a982-598d22148797/width=525/8aba58be-d439-4743-a982-598d22148797.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/0be968f8-9175-488c-a894-f7484ab062e6/width=525/0be968f8-9175-488c-a894-f7484ab062e6.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/b05bd149-1741-4e6d-850f-f33c22f67efc/width=525/b05bd149-1741-4e6d-850f-f33c22f67efc.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>","lang":"en","v":2,"o":{"en":"<p>A simple workflow that includes image generation with a Z-image checkpoint, Also include Controlnet.<br><br>** If<u>ModelPatchesLoader</u>node error occurs, try fixing it according to the note I provided in the workflow.<br><br><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/8aba58be-d439-4743-a982-598d22148797/width=525/8aba58be-d439-4743-a982-598d22148797.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/0be968f8-9175-488c-a894-f7484ab062e6/width=525/0be968f8-9175-488c-a894-f7484ab062e6.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/b05bd149-1741-4e6d-850f-f33c22f67efc/width=525/b05bd149-1741-4e6d-850f-f33c22f67efc.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>"}}